# Terminal Components
Terminal-themed UI components with authentic command-line aesthetic.
## Terminal Component
**Location:** `Terminal::Component`
Main terminal window container with header, prompt, and output areas.
### Subcomponents
- `Terminal::HeaderComponent` - Window title bar
- `Terminal::PromptComponent` - Command prompt line
- `Terminal::OutputComponent` - Command output display
- `Terminal::CursorComponent` - Blinking cursor animation
### Features
- Monaco font rendering
- Authentic terminal colors
- Window control buttons
- Animated cursor
- Scrollable content area
### Usage
```erb
<%= render Terminal::Component.new do %>
  <%= render Terminal::PromptComponent.new(command: "whoami") %>
  <%= render Terminal::OutputComponent.new(text: "matt.kelly") %>
<% end %>
```
## Terminal Header
**Location:** `Terminal::HeaderComponent`
Window title bar with control buttons.
### Parameters
- `title:` - Window title text (default: "terminal")
### Features
- Red/yellow/green control dots
- Centered title
- Tokyo Night background
## Terminal Prompt
**Location:** `Terminal::PromptComponent`
Command prompt with user@host format.
### Parameters
- `command:` - Command text to display
- `user:` - Username (default: "user")
- `host:` - Hostname (default: "localhost")
### Format
```
user@localhost:~$ command
```
## Terminal Output
**Location:** `Terminal::OutputComponent`
Displays command output with syntax highlighting support.
### Parameters
- `text:` - Output text
- `type:` - Output type (`:success`, `:error`, `:info`)
### Features
- Color-coded by type
- Preserves whitespace
- Monospace rendering
## Terminal Cursor
**Location:** `Terminal::CursorComponent`
Animated blinking cursor.
### Features
- CSS animation
- Tokyo Night cyan color
- 1s blink cycle
### Usage
```erb
<%= render Terminal::CursorComponent.new %>
```
