## Styling
Terminal components use:
- Font: `'Fira Code', monospace` (via `--font-code` CSS variable)
- Background: Tokyo Night `bg_float` (`#1f2335`)
- Text: Tokyo Night `fg` (`#a9b1d6`)
- Prompt color: Tokyo Night `green` (`#9ece6a`)
- Cursor color: Tokyo Night `cyan` (`#7dcfff`)
- Border: Tokyo Night `border` (`#29293f`)
